    "title": {
     "en": "Product launch"
    },
    "summary": {
     "en": "A small team's launch plan on a board, from final checks to the announcement and the week after."
    },
    "description": {
     "en": "A launch needs everyone to see the same plan. Start this template, [share the project](https://open-todo.app/docs/sharing/) with your team as editors, and show it as a [board](https://open-todo.app/docs/sections-and-boards/): Backlog, This week, Launch day, Week after.\n\nTasks carry estimates, so the [Week calendar](https://open-todo.app/docs/time-blocking/) shows whether the plan fits into the days you have."
    },
